cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "arterial1d-ska: one-dimensional blood flow in elastic arterial trees"
abstract: >-
  An independent Python/Numba solver for one-dimensional blood flow in elastic arterial trees
  (two-step MacCormack scheme), compatible with openBF's network file format, validated against
  the six benchmark cases of Boileau et al. (2015).
keywords:
  - haemodynamics
  - one-dimensional blood flow
  - pulse wave propagation
  - arterial network
